	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Keywords:
- zr: recent Zed projects
- zfo: open folder in Zed
- zfi: open file in Zed
- zn: open a new Zed window

Modifiers on results:
- ⌘↩ open in new window
- ⌥↩ reveal in Finder

Configure Workflow vars:
- ZED_CHANNEL
- ZED_LIMIT</string>
